 جَنَّتَانِ","Do momin / Do mard / Do giroh / Do baagh"],["Harf-e-Jarr / Nasb (+ ـَيْنِ)","مُؤْمِنَيْنِ / رَجُلَيْنِ / جَنَّتَيْنِ / وَالِدَيْنِ","Do mominon ko/se / Do mardon ko / Do baaghon mein / Maa-baap ke liye"],["Qur'ani Misaal","وَبِالْوَالِدَيْنِ إِحْسَانًا / مَرَجَ الْبَحْرَيْنِ","Aur maa-baap ke saath bhalai karo / Usne do samandar milaye"]]}},{"id":"sec_s3l10_concept","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u123grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u123grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 3 • LESSON 10</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Tasniyah (Dual — Do Cheezein / Afraad): مُؤْمِنٌ ← مُؤْمِنَانِ ، مُؤْمِنَيْنِ (Page 102)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">مُؤْمِنٌ ، آيَةٌ ، جَنَّةٌ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Tasniyah (ـَانِ / ـَيْنِ)</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">مُؤْمِنَانِ (مُؤْمِنَيْنِ) ، آيَتَانِ ، جَنَّتَانِ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• مُؤْمِنٌ ، آيَةٌ ، جَنَّةٌ (Ek momin, ek nishani, ek baagh) se مُؤْمِنَانِ (مُؤْمِنَيْنِ) ، آيَتَانِ ، جَنَّتَانِ (Do momin, do nishaniyan, do baagh) banta hai.</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Sifat-Mawsoof, Izaafat, Asmaa-ul-Faa'il aur Tasniyah Qur'ani tarakeeb ki buniyaad hain.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Page 102):** Arbi mein **do (2)** cheezon ya afraad (*Tasniyah / Dual*) ke liye wahid lafz ke aakhir mein **`ـَانِ`** (Alif + Noon Zair) ya **`ـَيْنِ`** (Yaa saakin + Noon Zair) lagaya jata hai: `مُؤْمِنٌ ← مُؤْمِنَانِ / مُؤْمِنَيْنِ` (do momin), `جَنَّةٌ ← جَنَّتَانِ / جَنَّتَيْنِ` (do baagh), `الْوَالِدَيْنِ` (maa-baap dono)."}},{"id":"sec_s3l10_r1","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Arabic zaban mein do (two) cheezon ya afraad par dalalat karne ke liye lafz ke aakhir mein \"ـَانِ\" (Alif aur Noon Maqsoor) ka izafa kiya jata hai, jaise \"الْمُؤْمِنُ\" (ek momin) se \"الْمُؤْمِنَانِ\" (do momin). Mandarja zail Qur'ani alfaaz ka tarjuma samajhiye:"}},{"id":"sec_s3l10_g2","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s3l10_g2_w1","arabic":"الْآيَةُ : الْآيَتَانِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْآيَةُ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">الْآيَتَانِ</span>","hinglish":"Ek nishani : Do nishaniyan","translations":{"en":"One sign : Two signs","ur":"ایک نشانی : دو نشانیاں","hi":"एक निशानी : दो निशानियाँ"}},{"id":"s3l10_g2_w2","arabic":"الْجَنَّةُ : الْجَنَّتَانِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْجَنَّةُ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">الْجَنَّتَانِ</span>","hinglish":"Ek baagh : Do baagh","translations":{"en":"One garden : Two gardens","ur":"ایک باغ : دو باغ","hi":"एक बाग़ : दो बाग़"}},{"id":"s3l10_g2_w3","arabic":"الْيَتِيمُ : الْيَتِيمَانِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْيَتِيمُ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">الْيَتِيمَانِ</span>","hinglish":"Ek yateem : Do yateem","translations":{"en":"One orphan : Two orphans","ur":"ایک یتیم : دو یتیم","hi":"एक यतीम : दो यतीम"}},{"id":"s3l10_g2_w4","arabic":"الْفَرِيقُ : الْفَرِيقَانِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْفَرِيقُ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">الْفَرِيقَانِ</span>","hinglish":"Ek giroh : Do giroh","translations":{"en":"One party : Two parties","ur":"ایک گروہ : دو گروہ","hi":"एक गिरोह : दो गिरोह"}},{"id":"s3l10_g2_w5","arabic":"الْمُسْلِمُ : الْمُسْلِمَانِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمُسْلِمُ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">الْمُسْلِمَانِ</span>","hinglish":"Ek muslim : Do muslim","translations":{"en":"One Muslim : Two Muslims","ur":"ایک مسلم : دو مسلم","hi":"एक मुस्लिम : दो मुस्लिम"}},{"id":"s3l10_g2_w6","arabic":"الْمُؤْمِنُ : الْمُؤْمِنَانِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمُؤْمِنُ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">الْمُؤْمِنَانِ</span>","hinglish":"Ek eemaan wala : Do eemaan wale","translations":{"en":"One believer : Two believers","ur":"ایک ایمان والا : دو ایمان والے","hi":"एक ईमान वाला : दो ईमान वाले"}},{"id":"s3l10_g2_w7","arabic":"الشَّهِيدُ : الشَّهِيدَانِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الشَّهِيدُ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">الشَّهِيدَانِ</span>","hinglish":"Ek gawaah : Do gawaah","translations":{"en":"One witness : Two witnesses","ur":"ایک گواہ : دو گواہ","hi":"एक गवाह : दो गवाह"}},{"id":"s3l10_g2_w8","arabic":"الْمَغْرِبُ : الْمَغْرِبَانِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمَغْرِبُ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">الْمَغْرِبَانِ</span>","hinglish":"Ek maghrib : Do maghrib","translations":{"en":"One west : Two wests","ur":"ایک مغرب : دو مغرب","hi":"एक मग़रिब : दो मग़रिब"}},{"id":"s3l10_g2_w9","arabic":"الْمَشْرِقُ : الْمَشْرِقَانِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمَشْرِقُ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">الْمَشْرِقَانِ</span>","hinglish":"Ek mashriq : Do mashriq","translations":{"en":"One east : Two easts","ur":"ایک مشرق : دو مشرق","hi":"एक मशरिक़ : दो मशरिक़"}},{"id":"s3l10_g2_w10","arabic":"السِّحْرُ : السِّحْرَانِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">السِّحْرُ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">السِّحْرَانِ</span>","hinglish":"Ek jaadoo : Do jaadoo","translations":{"en":"One magic : Two works of magic","ur":"ایک جادو : دو جادو","hi":"एक जादू : दो जादू"}},{"id":"s3l10_g2_w11","arabic":"السَّاحِرُ : السَّاحِرَانِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">السَّاحِرُ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">السَّاحِرَانِ</span>","hinglish":"Ek jaadugar : Do jaadugar","translations":{"en":"One magician : Two magicians","ur":"ایک جادوگر : دو جادوگر","hi":"एक जादूगर : दो जादूगर"}},{"id":"s3l10_g2_w12","arabic":"الْإِلٰهُ : الْإِلٰهَانِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْإِلٰهُ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">الْإِلٰهَانِ</span>","hinglish":"Ek ma'bood : Do ma'bood","translations":{"en":"One deity : Two deities","ur":"ایک معبود : دو معبود","hi":"एक माबूद : दो माबूद"}},{"id":"s3l10_g2_w13","arabic":"الْقَرْيَةُ : الْقَرْيَتَانِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْقَرْيَةُ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">الْقَرْيَتَانِ</span>","hinglish":"Ek basti : Do bastiyan","translations":{"en":"One town : Two towns","ur":"ایک بستی : دو بستیاں","hi":"एक बस्ती : दो बस्तियाँ"}},{"id":"s3l10_g2_w14","arabic":"الْمَلَكُ : الْمَلَكَانِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمَلَكُ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">الْمَلَكَانِ</span>","hinglish":"Ek farishta : Do farishte","translations":{"en":"One angel : Two angels","ur":"ایک فرشتہ : دو فرشتے","hi":"एक फ़रिश्ता : दो फ़रिश्ते"}},{"id":"s3l10_g2_w15","arabic":"الْبَحْرُ 