: </span><span class=\"nonroot\">الْمَرْأَتَانِ</span>","hinglish":"Ek aurat : Do aurtein","translations":{"en":"One woman : Two women","ur":"ایک عورت : دو عورتیں","hi":"एक औरत : दो औरतें"}},{"id":"s3l10_g2_w29","arabic":"الْأَلْفُ : الْأَلْفَانِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْأَلْفُ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">الْأَلْفَانِ</span>","hinglish":"Ek hazar : Do hazar","translations":{"en":"One thousand : Two thousand","ur":"ایک ہزار : دو ہزار","hi":"एक हज़ार : दो हज़ार"}},{"id":"s3l10_g2_w30","arabic":"الْمِائَةُ : الْمِائَتَانِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمِائَةُ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">الْمِائَتَانِ</span>","hinglish":"Ek sau : Do sau","translations":{"en":"One hundred : Two hundred","ur":"ایک سو : دو سو","hi":"एक सौ : दो सौ"}},{"id":"s3l10_g2_w31","arabic":"الزَّوْجُ : الزَّوْجَانِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الزَّوْجُ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">الزَّوْجَانِ</span>","hinglish":"Ek jora : Miya-biwi (Jora)","translations":{"en":"One mate : Two spouses (A couple)","ur":"ایک جوڑا : میاں بیوی (جوڑا)","hi":"एक जोड़ा : मियाँ-बीवी (जोड़ा)"}},{"id":"s3l10_g2_w32","arabic":"الْأُخْتُ : الْأُخْتَانِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْأُخْتُ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">الْأُخْتَانِ</span>","hinglish":"Ek behn : Do behnein","translations":{"en":"One sister : Two sisters","ur":"ایک بہن : دو بہنیں","hi":"एक बहन : दो बहनें"}},{"id":"s3l10_g2_w33","arabic":"الْعَبْدُ : الْعَبْدَانِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْعَبْدُ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">الْعَبْدَانِ</span>","hinglish":"Ek banda : Do bande","translations":{"en":"One servant : Two servants","ur":"ایک بندہ : دو بندے","hi":"एक बन्दा : दो बन्दे"}}],"cols":3}},{"id":"sec_s3l10_lbl3","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Tasniyah Ki Mansoob Aur Majroor Haalat"}},{"id":"sec_s3l10_r4","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Baaz auqaat aisi Tasniyah ke aakhir mein \"ـَانِ\" badal kar \"ـَيْنِ\" (Yaa aur Noon) ho jata hai jaise \"الْوَالِدَانِ\" se \"الْوَالِدَيْنِ\" aur \"الْمَشْرِقَانِ\" se \"الْمَشْرِقَيْنِ\". Iss tabdeeli se maana mein koi farq nahi padta, sirf I'raab (case) ki tabdeeli hoti hai."}},{"id":"sec_s3l10_g5","type":"grace_box","data":{"text":"Quran Majeed mein dono haalaton ki misaalein aati hain: الْجَنَّتَانِ / الْجَنَّتَيْنِ, الْوَالِدَانِ / الْوَالِدَيْنِ, الْمَغْرِبَانِ / الْمَغْرِبَيْنِ, الْمَشْرِقَانِ / الْمَشْرِقَيْنِ. In sab mein do (two) ka mafhoom barqarar rehta hai."}},{"id":"sec_s3l10_vlbl","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Qur'ani Aayaat mein Tasniyah (ـَانِ / ـَيْنِ) ki Exercise (Numbered 1–6)"}},{"id":"sec_s3l10_v","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":true,"items":[{"id":"s3l10_v_s1","sentence_number":1,"arabic":"وَقَالَ اللَّهُ لَا تَتَّخِذُوا إِلَٰهَيْنِ اثْنَيْنِ إِنَّمَا هُوَ إِلَٰهٌ وَاحِدٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَقَالَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهُ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">تَتَّخِذ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ُوا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِلَٰه</span><span class=\"nonroot\">َيْنِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اثْن</span><span class=\"nonroot\">َيْنِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّمَا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هُوَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِلَٰهٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَاحِدٌ</span>","hinglish":"Aur Allah ne farmaya: Do ma'bood mat banao, woh toh bas ek hi Ma'bood hai","translations":{"ur":"اور اللہ نے فرمایا: دو معبود نہ بناؤ، معبود تو بس ایک ہی ہے","en":"And Allah has said: Do not take for yourselves two deities; He is only One God","hi":"और अल्लाह ने फ़रमाया: दो माबूद न बनाओ, माबूद तो बस एक ही है"},"ref":"16:51"},{"id":"s3l10_v_s2","sentence_number":2,"arabic":"وَضَرَبَ اللَّهُ مَثَلًا رَجُلَيْنِ أَحَدُهُمَا أَبْكَمُ لَا يَقْدِرُ عَلَىٰ شَيْءٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَضَرَبَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَثَلًا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَجُل</span><span class=\"nonroot\">َيْنِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَحَدُهُمَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَبْكَمُ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يَقْدِرُ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَىٰ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">شَيْءٍ</span>","hinglish":"Aur Allah ne do mardon ki misaal bayaan ki jin mein se ek goonga hai jo kisi cheez par qudrat nahin rakhta","translations":{"ur":"اور اللہ نے دو آدمیوں کی مثال بیان فرمائی جن میں سے ایک گونگا ہے اور کسی چیز پر قدرت نہیں رکھتا","en":"And Allah presents an example of two men, one of them dumb and unable to do a thing","hi":"और अल्लाह ने दो आदमियों की मिसाल बयान फ़रमाई जिनमें से एक गूँगा है और किसी चीज़ पर क़ुदरत नहीं रखता"},"ref":"16:76"},{"id":"s3l10_v_s3","sentence_number":3,"arabic":"لَقَدْ كَانَ لِسَبَإٍ فِي مَسْكَنِهِمْ آيَةٌ جَنَّتَانِ عَنْ يَمِينٍ وَشِمَالٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَقَدْ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">كَانَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">لِسَبَإٍ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">فِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَسْكَنِهِمْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">آيَةٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">جَنَّت</span><span class=\"nonroot\">َانِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">عَنْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يَمِينٍ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَشِمَالٍ</span>","hinglish":"Yaqeenan Saba walon ke liye unke rehne ki jagah mein ek nishani thi: do baagh daayein aur baayein","translations":{"ur":"بیشک قومِ سبا کے لیے ان کے مسکن ہی میں ایک نشانی تھی: دائیں اور بائیں دو باغ","en":"There was for Saba' in their dwelling place a sign: two gardens on the right and on the left","hi":"बेशक क़ौम-ए-सबा के लिए उनके मस्कन ही में एक निशानी थी: दाएँ और बाएँ दो बाग़"},"ref":"34:15"},{"id":"s3l10_v_s4","sentence_number":4,"arabic":"وَوَصَّيْنَا الْإِنْسَانَ بِوَالِدَيْهِ إِحْسَانًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَوَصَّي</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ْنَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْإِنْسَانَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بِوَالِدَيْهِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِحْسَانًا</span>","hinglish":"Aur hamne insaan ko uske maa-baap ke saath bhalai karne ki takeed ki","translations":{"ur":"اور ہم نے انسان کو اس کے ماں باپ کے ساتھ بھلائی کرنے کی تاکید کی","en":"And We have enjoined upon man goodness to his parents","hi":"और हमने इंसान को उसके माँ-बाप के साथ भलाई करने की ताकीद की"},"ref":"46:15"},{"id":"s3l10_v_s5","sentence_number":5,"arabic":"مَرَجَ الْبَحْرَيْنِ يَلْتَقِيَانِ بَيْنَهُمَا بَرْزَخٌ لَا يَبْغِيَانِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">مَرَجَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْبَحْر</span><span class=\"nonroot\">َيْنِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يَلْتَقِي</span><span class=\"nonroot\">َانِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بَيْنَهُمَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بَرْزَخٌ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يَبْغِي</span><span class=\"nonroot\">َانِ</span>","hinglish":"Usne do samandar chhode jo aapas mein milte hain, un dono ke darmiyan ek aisi aadh hai ke woh hadd se nahin badhte","translations":{"ur":"اس نے دو سمندروں کو رواں کیا جو آپس میں ملتے ہیں، ان دونوں کے درمیان ایک آڑ ہے کہ وہ حد سے تجاوز نہیں کرتے","en":"He released the two seas, meeting side by side; between them is a barrier so neither of them transgresses","hi":"उसने दो समुंदरों को रवाँ किया जो आपस में मिलते हैं, उन दोनों के दरमियान एक आड़ है कि वे हद से तजावुज़ नहीं करते"},"ref":"55:19-20"},{"id":"s3l10_v_s6","sentence_number":6,"arabic":"وَلِمَنْ خَافَ مَقَامَ رَبِّهِ جَنَّتَانِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَلِمَنْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">خَافَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَقَامَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبِّهِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">جَنَّت</span><span class=\"nonroot\">َانِ</span>","hinglish":"Aur jo apne Rabb ke saamne khade hone se dara uske liye do baagh hain","translations":{"ur":"اور جو شخص اپنے رب کے سامنے کھڑے ہونے سے ڈرا اس کے لیے دو جنتیں ہیں","en":"And for he who feared the standing before his Lord are two gardens","hi":"और जो शख़्स अपने रब के सामने खड़े होने से डरा उसके लिए दो जन्नतें हैं"},"ref":"55:46"}]}}]}}